---
// FAQ.astro
---

<section id="faq" class="faq-section">
  <div class="container-max">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <div class="badge badge-amber">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line></svg>
        <span data-i18n="faq.badge">常见问题</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="faq.title">解答你的疑惑</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-accordion-list">
      <!-- Question 1 -->
      <details class="faq-item" open>
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span data-i18n="faq.q1">接收分享链接的人需要安装 Highlight Share 扩展吗？</span>
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p data-i18n="faq.a1">
            完全不需要！Highlight Share 生成的链接基于现代浏览器通用的 W3C Text Fragment 标准（#:~:text=...），Chrome、Edge、Safari、Opera 等现代浏览器原生支持自动滚动并高亮目标文本。
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 2 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span data-i18n="faq.q2">高亮数据会保存在哪里？换电脑后还在吗？</span>
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p data-i18n="faq.a2">
            所有高亮数据均保存在本地浏览器的 Local Storage / Chrome Storage 中，完全私密安全。因为没有中心服务器，换电脑时不会自动同步，保证了绝对的隐私。
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 3 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span data-i18n="faq.q3">支持快捷键操作吗？</span>
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p data-i18n="faq.a3">
            支持！你可以通过快捷键快速打开侧边栏，选中文本后浮动工具栏支持快捷回车高亮，提升极速阅读体验。
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 4 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span data-i18n="faq.q4">可以导出或批量复制多条高亮吗？</span>
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p data-i18n="faq.a4">
            可以！在侧边栏中你可以通过勾选框多选任意几条或全部高亮，一键点击「复制文本」即可获得整齐排版的笔记内容。
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question 5 -->
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          <span data-i18n="faq.q5">如果不小心高亮错了，怎么修改或删除？</span>
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p data-i18n="faq.a5">
            直接用鼠标点击网页上的任意高亮区域，即可弹出编辑工具栏，支持一键切换颜色、复制或点击垃圾桶图标删除。
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-section {
    padding: 5.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }

  .faq-accordion-list {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 3.5rem auto 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.875rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: var(--bg-page);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .faq-item[open] {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .faq-question {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .faq-question::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-chevron {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .faq-item[open] .faq-chevron {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .faq-answer {
    padding: 0 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
</style>
